_4984398909412926887_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zX7ftl79mysQ7kNvwEQz4E8&_nc_oc=Adnh4iawi7ts_AWZZ73k7RxwudYJCGSZdluF8mhlSPEuFxrbWd0N3wO7FHg9dwcvoz0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftiZ8swzGJ5jM1kh6A1Ajq0S-uFnI6kHn0TNf2DF1OAYQ&oe=69A43829"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Wide.png", "id": "1537180897082998", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035399_1537180900416331_3308939231393192739_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9XM6nJMe_UUQ7kNvwGp0vVW&_nc_oc=AdnItpUiI_hOuAX7OSgl5ftM8iOrO7KKFQJ0jugDDrBxM9wGdf0TgLQ3R_rAV9HYqIw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvDM-i6QjIjx5KQy4csPiPTEOqPpH6n00omwME2SFBXzg&oe=69A4298D"}, "display_name": "Christmas Ride", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to a virtual winter wonderland in our enchanting VR game, where the magic of Christmas comes alive! Designed specifically for a younger audience, this game offers a unique blend of excitement and festive spirit, perfect for the holiday season.\n\nAs you step into Santa's boots, you'll embark on a joyful sleigh ride across the starlit skies. \n\nWith its cheerful graphics, enchanting soundtrack, and easy-to-learn gameplay, our VR Santa sleigh ride is the perfect game for young players and families looking to add a dash of festive fun to their gaming experience. So put on your VR headset and join Santa on this unforgettable holiday adventure!\"", "short_description": "Join Santa on a magical sleigh ride in our delightful VR game! Perfect for young players, this happy roller coaster adventure lets you help Santa deliver presents. Grab your controllers and soar through a festive world, spreading joy and holiday cheer!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.wingsgames.com/policy-christmasride", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wings Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://w